<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>标签云 on BoilTask's Blog</title><link>https://boiltask.com/tags/</link><description>Recent content in 标签云 on BoilTask's Blog</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 26 Jan 2026 22:37:41 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://boiltask.com/tags/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>GAMES104现代游戏引擎</title><link>https://boiltask.com/tags/games104-game-engine/</link><pubDate>Mon, 26 Jan 2026 22:37:41 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://boiltask.com/tags/games104-game-engine/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;课程官网：&lt;a class="link" href="https://games104.boomingtech.com/sc/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
&gt;GAMES104 - 现代游戏引擎入门必修课&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;视频网址：&lt;a class="link" href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1oU4y1R7Km" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
&gt;GAMES104-现代游戏引擎：从入门到实践&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>博客</title><link>https://boiltask.com/tags/blog/</link><pubDate>Fri, 16 Jan 2026 13:08:03 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://boiltask.com/tags/blog/</guid><description/></item><item><title>爷爷奶奶的诗</title><link>https://boiltask.com/tags/poems-of-grandparents/</link><pubDate>Fri, 16 Jan 2026 12:26:18 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://boiltask.com/tags/poems-of-grandparents/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;爷爷离去距今已经一年多了，近来时常回忆涌起却又无可奈何。想起来之前说过再整理整理爷爷奶奶写过的诗，于是摘录下来做成了本系列，聊以慰藉吧。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>UnrealEngine</title><link>https://boiltask.com/tags/unrealengine/</link><pubDate>Wed, 07 Jan 2026 23:33:49 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://boiltask.com/tags/unrealengine/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;大方无隅，大器晚成，大音希声，大象无形，道隐无名。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;span class="cite"&gt;&lt;span&gt;― &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;老子, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.daodejing.org/"&gt;&lt;cite&gt;道德经&lt;/cite&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;虚幻引擎作为一个维护了数十年的项目，其中涉及到的算法、架构、软件工程等知识是极为复杂庞大的，对于个人来说很难在有限的时间里完全掌握整个项目。然而，对于每个人来说，所需要引擎提供的能力各不相同，因此我们能在有限的时间内，尽可能得了解和掌握虚幻引擎的某一方面。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>待办</title><link>https://boiltask.com/tags/todo/</link><pubDate>Wed, 17 Dec 2025 12:44:18 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://boiltask.com/tags/todo/</guid><description/></item><item><title>DidaOJ</title><link>https://boiltask.com/tags/didaoj/</link><pubDate>Wed, 03 Dec 2025 12:59:47 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://boiltask.com/tags/didaoj/</guid><description/></item><item><title>博弈论</title><link>https://boiltask.com/tags/game-theory/</link><pubDate>Wed, 03 Dec 2025 12:59:47 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://boiltask.com/tags/game-theory/</guid><description/></item><item><title>动态规划</title><link>https://boiltask.com/tags/dp/</link><pubDate>Wed, 03 Dec 2025 12:25:25 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://boiltask.com/tags/dp/</guid><description/></item><item><title>模拟</title><link>https://boiltask.com/tags/simulate/</link><pubDate>Wed, 03 Dec 2025 12:25:25 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://boiltask.com/tags/simulate/</guid><description/></item><item><title>项目</title><link>https://boiltask.com/tags/project/</link><pubDate>Wed, 29 Oct 2025 12:57:16 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://boiltask.com/tags/project/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Lyra</title><link>https://boiltask.com/tags/lyra/</link><pubDate>Fri, 05 Sep 2025 12:59:55 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://boiltask.com/tags/lyra/</guid><description/></item><item><title>SVN</title><link>https://boiltask.com/tags/svn/</link><pubDate>Wed, 16 Jul 2025 22:49:11 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://boiltask.com/tags/svn/</guid><description/></item><item><title>思维题</title><link>https://boiltask.com/tags/thinking-problem/</link><pubDate>Sun, 08 Jun 2025 20:30:33 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://boiltask.com/tags/thinking-problem/</guid><description/></item><item><title>数论</title><link>https://boiltask.com/tags/number-theory/</link><pubDate>Sun, 08 Jun 2025 16:01:12 +0800</pubDate><guid>h